# Keep local credentials, development environments, and mutable data out of images.
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.venv
**/.venv*
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage*
**/htmlcov
**/node_modules
**/.dart_tool
**/build
**/mlruns
**/.mlflow
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
